    "text": "Westfield\nMills homers for sixth time in Starfires’ midweek matchup with Bravehearts\nBy Joey Roiger |,\n1 hours agoNorthwestern product Griffin Mills hit his sixth home run and notched his 18th and 19th RBIs, but the Worcester Bravehearts avenged a 13-3 mercy-rule loss to the Starfires on July 13 by topping Westfield 17-6 in seven innings on Wednesday at Bullens Field.",
